          [-3.342, 55.937],
          [-3.19, 55.95]
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Stirling, the Trossachs and Loch Lomond",
        "highlights": [
          "Stirling Castle and the ground where Bannockburn was fought",
          "Lunch on a private estate",
          "An afternoon to suit you: falconry, time on the water, or simply the view"
